# ACM Source MCP - Source Code Discovery

**MCP Server Name**: `user-acm-source`

**Repositories Covered:**

| Key | Repository | Description |
|-----|------------|-------------|
| `acm` | `stolostron/console` | ACM Console source code |
| `kubevirt` | `kubevirt-ui/kubevirt-plugin` | Fleet Virtualization UI source code |
| `acm-e2e` | `stolostron/clc-ui-e2e` | Cluster Lifecycle + RBAC selectors (ACM 2.15+) |
| `search-e2e` | `stolostron/search-e2e-test` | Search component selectors |
| `app-e2e` | `stolostron/application-ui-test` | Applications (ALC) selectors |
| `grc-e2e` | `stolostron/acmqe-grc-test` | Governance (GRC) selectors |

**QE repos use `main` branch.** All tools work with them:
```python
search_code("policy", repo="grc-e2e")
get_component_source("tests/cypress/views/search.js", repo="search-e2e")
find_test_ids("tests/cypress/views/application.js", repo="app-e2e")
```

**Other ACM Repos (not in MCP):**
- **Foundation**: `stolostron/acmqe-foundation-test` (backend-focused)
- **Observability**: `stolostron/multicluster-observability-operator`
- **Install**: `stolostron/acmqe-autotest`

