## Version Management (CRITICAL)

ACM and CNV versions are **INDEPENDENT**. Always set the correct version before searching:

| Version Type | Sets Branch For | Command |
|--------------|-----------------|---------|
| ACM Version | `stolostron/console` | `set_acm_version('2.16')` |
| CNV Version | `kubevirt-ui/kubevirt-plugin` | `set_cnv_version('4.20')` |

**Supported ACM Versions:**

| Version | Branch | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| 2.11-2.18 | `release-2.XX` | GA releases |
| 2.19 | `main` | Development (next unreleased) |
| `latest` | -> 2.18 | Current GA (ACM 5.0 = 2.18) |

**Supported CNV Versions:**

| Version | Branch | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| 4.14-4.22 | `release-4.XX` | GA releases (match OCP version) |
| 4.23 | `main` | Development (next release) |
| `latest` | -> 4.22 | Current GA (ships with ACM 5.0 / OCP 4.18) |

