## Available Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| `list_repos()` | Show current version status | Shows ACM and CNV versions |
| `list_versions()` | Show ALL supported versions | Lists 2.11-2.17 and 4.14-4.22 |
| `set_acm_version(version)` | Set ACM Console version | `set_acm_version('2.16')` |
| `set_cnv_version(version)` | Set Fleet Virt UI version | `set_cnv_version('4.20')` |
| `detect_cnv_version()` | Auto-detect CNV from cluster | Sets kubevirt branch from cluster |
| `search_code(query, repo, scope)` | Search code. scope="all" (GitHub search, default) or "components" (directory walk) | `search_code("VMActionModal", repo="acm")` |
| `get_component_source(path, repo)` | Get file source | `get_component_source("path/to/file.tsx", repo="acm")` |
| `find_test_ids(path, repo)` | Extract test IDs | `find_test_ids("component.tsx", repo="kubevirt")` |
| `get_fleet_virt_selectors()` | Get Cypress selectors | Returns selectors from kubevirt |
| `search_translations(query, exact)` | Find UI text/labels (partial match default) | `search_translations("Create role")` |
| `get_acm_selectors(source, component)` | Get ACM Console selectors | `get_acm_selectors('catalog', 'grc')` |
| `get_component_types(path, repo)` | Extract TS types/interfaces | `get_component_types("types.ts", repo="acm")` |
| `get_wizard_steps(path, repo)` | Analyze wizard structure | `get_wizard_steps("WizardModal.tsx", repo="acm")` |
| `get_routes()` | Get all navigation paths | Returns 112+ ACM routes |
| `get_patternfly_selectors(component)` | PatternFly CSS selectors | `get_patternfly_selectors('wizard')` |

**Removed tools:**
- `set_version` -- use `set_acm_version` or `set_cnv_version` instead
- `search_component` -- use `search_code(query, repo, scope="components")` instead

