## Related MCP Gotchas (Quick Reference)

### JIRA MCP (`jira`)
- `get_issue` does NOT return issue links. Use `search_issues` with JQL for linked tickets.
- Comments are inline in get_issue response -- read ALL of them for implementation decisions.
- JQL is case-sensitive: `fixVersion` not `fix_version`. String values must be quoted.
- Component mapping: Governance="Governance", RBAC/Virt="Virtualization", Clusters="Cluster Lifecycle", Search="Search", Apps="Application Lifecycle"

### Polarion MCP (`polarion`)
- Project ID is ALWAYS `RHACM4K` for ACM test cases.
- Query syntax is Lucene, NOT JQL: `type:testcase AND title:"feature"` (not `type = testcase`)
- `get_polarion_work_item_text` sometimes returns empty. Use `get_polarion_work_item(fields="@all")` as fallback.
- VPN required for Polarion access.
- Plan IDs use underscores: `ACM_2_16`, `MCE_2_8` (not dots or spaces).

### Neo4j RHACM MCP (`neo4j-rhacm`)
- ~370 components, 7 subsystems, 541 relationships.
- Requires Podman with neo4j-rhacm container running.
- All queries are read-only (--read-only flag).
- If unavailable, skip dependency analysis (graceful degradation).
